    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As Dragonborn Fenari take on draconic traits, their fur gives way to soft scales in a color drawn from the dragons of their adopted home. Choose a color from the table. It determines your <strong>Dragon's Breath</strong> and <strong>Dragonfire Fangs</strong> damage type.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Scales</th><th>Damage Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Black</td><td>Acid</td></tr><tr><td>Blue</td><td>Lightning</td></tr><tr><td>Brass</td><td>Fire</td></tr><tr><td>Bronze</td><td>Lightning</td></tr><tr><td>Copper</td><td>Acid</td></tr><tr><td>Gold</td><td>Fire</td></tr><tr><td>Green</td><td>Poison</td></tr><tr><td>Red</td><td>Fire</td></tr><tr><td>Silver</td><td>Cold</td></tr><tr><td>White</td><td>Cold</td></tr></tbody></table>",
